                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakati wa mwisho wa ufalme wao, wakosao watakapotimia, mfalme mwenye uso mkali, afahamuye mafumbo, atasimama. ",
          "type": "text",
